TypeScript is a strongly typed, object oriented, compiled language.
Features of typescript:
1. Typescript is just javascript.
2. typescript supports other js library:- any javascript can consume compiled .ts file.
3. java script is typescript:-any js file can be renamed to .ts and can be complied along with other ts files.
4.typescript is portable:- any device that supports javascript , will support typescript.
5. compilation time error:- it will give complitaion time error if any syntax error found.
6.Strong Static Typing
7.TypeScript supports Object Oriented Programming concepts like classes, interfaces, inheritance, etc.


//Components of typescript
1.Language :- combinationof syntax, keywords and type annotation.
2. Typescript compiler (tsc)- that converts .ts code to .js code .
3. The TypeScript Language Service : 


